      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When aiming for a high-dose saturation without GI distress, you can significantly improve absorption by pairing your glycine with a small amount of medium-chain triglycerides (MCTs). The fat helps buffer the stomach and promotes a more efficient uptake across the intestinal wall. Additionally, incorporating a broad-spectrum digestive enzyme blend, taken just before ingestion, can pre-digest the compounds and minimize the digestive load. This combination is designed to optimize bioavailability while keeping your system smooth for peak performance.",
