      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes a lot of sense, the MCT idea is clever. i'll definitely add that in. \n\none more thing regarding the logistics of this 10-day window—to make sure i'm hitting the absolute maximum saturation, i've seen some people suggest that instead of splitting the 500mg into small doses, it's actually better to take it all at once in a single, massive dose right before bed to let the body process it during deep sleep cycles. \n\nis there any physiological advantage to doing a single \"mega-bolus\" like that for maximum absorption efficiency, or is the split-dosing still the gold standard for a high-performance protocol?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
